silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_flat_sections_03_olog_node_arrow_law_yoneda_hom_leg_10 silm:hasExample "In '03OlogNodeArrowLawYonedaHomLeg10', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, Felis catus (TSN 183798) is the taxonomy leg of Mittens; it is not Mittens." .
